        "body": "## Summary\n- freeze and sanitize one SQLite image before any remote mutation, then use its SHA-256 for D1 and R2 identity\n- publish all nine Gitcrawl cloud-v2 datasets with rotating mutation tokens, complete coverage activation, and explicit cutover\n- fail closed on stale or incomplete revisions, fingerprints, summaries, clusters, and PR hydration unless explicitly overridden\n- strip raw JSON, patches, blobs, local source indexes, and private local paths before bundle hashing\n- consume CrawlKit snapshot provenance and immutable bundle-key support from openclaw/crawlkit#50\n\n## Tests\n- `GOWORK=off go mod tidy`\n- `GOWORK=off go vet ./...`\n- `GOWORK=off go test ./... -count=1`\n- `GOWORK=off go test -race ./internal/cli ./internal/store -count=1`\n\n## Dependencies\n- https://github.com/openclaw/crawlkit/pull/50\n- https://github.com/openclaw/crawl-remote/pull/36\n",
